Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vu-a3em/a3em-dashboard
Description: A3EM dashboard helper for SD cards
 Lets the A3EM dashboard, through its browser extension, prepare SD cards for
 A3EM recorders: it checks that a card really holds what it claims, formats it
 with the exact layout the recorder firmware expects, verifies the result, and
 writes the deployment's configuration.
